// A d3-force simulation (bundled in the d3 v4 build above) that pushes
// overlapping points apart while a weak spring keeps every point anchored
// near its real on-screen position. Anchor targets are LIVE accessor
// functions -- x(currentXVal[i]), y(currentYVal[i]) -- so the simulation
// automatically tracks pan/zoom and even an in-flight coordinate-mode
// transition without any extra bookkeeping; it just keeps chasing wherever
// the point "really" is right now.
