// —— Size range: a dual-thumb slider (two overlapping native <input
// type="range"> elements, styled so only their thumbs are interactive)
// that sets radiusClampMin/radiusClampMax, the smallest/largest a point's
// on-screen radius (in px) is ever allowed to render at. Linear scale here
